{"title":"Career Roadmap — Data Analyst","role":"Data Analyst","summary":"A Data Analyst transforms raw data into meaningful insights that help organizations make better operational, financial, marketing, product, and strategic decisions.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc (Bachelor of Science – General / Honours)","Course":"Statistics"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Data Analyst transforms raw data into meaningful insights that help organizations make better operational, financial, marketing, product, and strategic decisions."},{"type":"p","text":"For a B.Sc Statistics graduate, this is a highly aligned career because statistical reasoning provides a strong foundation for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data interpretation"},{"text":"Statistical analysis"},{"text":"Experimentation"},{"text":"Forecasting"},{"text":"Business intelligence"},{"text":"Predictive analytics"},{"text":"Data visualization"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The student should complement statistics with:"},{"type":"flow","items":["SQL","Excel","Python","Power BI/Tableau","Statistics","Business Understanding"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong long-term profile can progress from Data Analyst → Senior Data Analyst → Analytics Specialist → Analytics Lead/Manager, or branch into Data Science, Product Analytics, Business Analytics, Risk Analytics or BI Engineering."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Development Focus","Typical Position"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Statistics, SQL, Excel, Python, visualization"},{"text":"Data Analyst Intern / Junior Analyst"}],[{"text":"2030–2033"},{"text":"Business analytics, dashboards, reporting, experimentation"},{"text":"Data Analyst"}],[{"text":"2033–2037"},{"text":"Advanced analytics, forecasting, product/business intelligence"},{"text":"Senior Data Analyst"}],[{"text":"2037–2041"},{"text":"Analytics specialization and stakeholder leadership"},{"text":"Analytics Lead / Analytics Consultant"}],[{"text":"2041–2046"},{"text":"Strategy, analytics architecture and team leadership"},{"text":"Analytics Manager / Head of Analytics"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During B.Sc","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Statistical & Programming Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Descriptive statistics"},{"text":"Probability"},{"text":"Basic inferential statistics"},{"text":"Mathematics"},{"text":"Data collection"},{"text":"Sampling"},{"text":"Statistical reasoning"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Programming:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python fundamentals"},{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"Jupyter"},{"text":"Git"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Also learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel fundamentals"},{"text":"Basic SQL"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Goal"},{"type":"p","text":"Become comfortable taking a small dataset and answering:"},{"type":"p","text":"What happened, why might it have happened, and what does the data actually support?"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Applied Statistics & Data Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop strong knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Probability distributions"},{"text":"Statistical inference"},{"text":"Hypothesis testing"},{"text":"Correlation"},{"text":"Regression"},{"text":"ANOVA"},{"text":"Sampling techniques"},{"text":"Experimental design"},{"text":"Time-series fundamentals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Technical skills:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"Matplotlib"},{"text":"Seaborn"},{"text":"Power BI/Tableau"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Start working with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business datasets"},{"text":"Sales data"},{"text":"Customer data"},{"text":"Financial data"},{"text":"Marketing data"},{"text":"Operations data"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Professional Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Prioritize:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Multivariate analysis"},{"text":"Regression modelling"},{"text":"Time-series analysis"},{"text":"Forecasting"},{"text":"Statistical modelling"},{"text":"Experimental design"},{"text":"A/B testing"},{"text":"Data storytelling"},{"text":"Business intelligence"},{"text":"Dashboard development"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Advanced technical areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SQL optimization"},{"text":"Python analytics"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"DAX"},{"text":"Data modelling"},{"text":"ETL concepts"},{"text":"APIs"},{"text":"Basic cloud data platforms"},{"text":"The final-year project should ideally solve a real-world decision problem using data."}]}]},{"heading":"Core Statistics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Statistics should remain the student's biggest differentiator."},{"type":"h","text":"Descriptive Statistics"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mean"},{"text":"Median"},{"text":"Mode"},{"text":"Variance"},{"text":"Standard deviation"},{"text":"Percentiles"},{"text":"Quartiles"},{"text":"Distribution shape"},{"text":"Outlier detection"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Probability"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Conditional probability"},{"text":"Bayes' theorem"},{"text":"Random variables"},{"text":"Expected value"},{"text":"Variance"},{"text":"Probability distributions"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Important distributions:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Normal"},{"text":"Binomial"},{"text":"Poisson"},{"text":"Exponential"},{"text":"t-distribution"},{"text":"Chi-square"},{"text":"F-distribution"}]}]},{"heading":"Inferential Statistics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"note","label":"Target","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Confidence intervals"},{"text":"Hypothesis testing"},{"text":"p-values"},{"text":"Statistical power"},{"text":"Effect size"},{"text":"Type I/II errors"},{"text":"Parametric tests"},{"text":"Non-parametric tests"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Important tests:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"t-test"},{"text":"Chi-square test"},{"text":"ANOVA"},{"text":"Mann-Whitney U"},{"text":"Wilcoxon tests"},{"text":"Correlation tests"},{"text":"A professional analyst should understand that statistical significance does not automatically imply business significance."}]}]},{"heading":"Regression & Predictive Analytics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Linear Regression"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Coefficients"},{"text":"Residuals"},{"text":"R²"},{"text":"Adjusted R²"},{"text":"Assumptions"},{"text":"Multicollinearity"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Logistic Regression"},{"type":"p","text":"Applications:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer churn"},{"text":"Conversion prediction"},{"text":"Default prediction"},{"text":"Classification"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced Topics"},{"type":"p","text":"Later explore:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Regularization"},{"text":"Decision trees"},{"text":"Random forests"},{"text":"Gradient boosting"},{"text":"Clustering"},{"text":"Dimensionality reduction"},{"text":"The objective is not to turn every analyst into a machine-learning engineer, but to understand when predictive methods are appropriate."}]}]},{"heading":"SQL","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"SQL should be a core professional skill."},{"type":"note","label":"Target","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SELECT"},{"text":"WHERE"},{"text":"GROUP BY"},{"text":"HAVING"},{"text":"ORDER BY"},{"text":"JOIN"},{"text":"CASE"},{"text":"CTE"},{"text":"Subqueries"},{"text":"Window Functions"},{"text":"Views"},{"text":"Aggregations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Important concepts:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"INNER JOIN"},{"text":"LEFT JOIN"},{"text":"UNION"},{"text":"ROW_NUMBER"},{"text":"RANK"},{"text":"DENSE_RANK"},{"text":"LAG"},{"text":"LEAD"},{"text":"Running totals"},{"text":"Rolling averages"},{"text":"A strong analyst should be able to extract and transform business data without depending entirely on others."}]}]},{"heading":"Excel","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"note","label":"Target","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"INDEX/MATCH"},{"text":"SUMIFS"},{"text":"COUNTIFS"},{"text":"IF/IFS"},{"text":"TEXT functions"},{"text":"Date functions"},{"text":"Pivot Tables"},{"text":"Pivot Charts"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Data validation"},{"text":"Conditional formatting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Advanced:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Power Pivot"},{"text":"Data modelling"},{"text":"Basic VBA where useful"},{"text":"Excel remains important because many business teams use it for rapid analysis and decision-making."}]}]},{"heading":"Python for Data Analytics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"note","label":"Target","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"p","text":"Recommended stack:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"├── NumPy"},{"text":"├── pandas"},{"text":"├── Matplotlib"},{"text":"├── Seaborn"},{"text":"├── SciPy"},{"text":"├── statsmodels"},{"text":"├── scikit-learn"},{"text":"└── Jupyter"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use Python for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Exploratory data analysis"},{"text":"Statistical testing"},{"text":"Regression"},{"text":"Forecasting"},{"text":"Automation"},{"text":"Data visualization"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Example workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Raw Dataset","Data Cleaning","Exploratory Analysis","Statistical Analysis","Visualization","Business Interpretation","Recommendation"]}]},{"heading":"Data Visualization & BI","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Data Analyst must be able to communicate findings visually."},{"type":"h","text":"Power BI"},{"type":"note","label":"Target","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data import"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Data transformation"},{"text":"Data modelling"},{"text":"Relationships"},{"text":"DAX"},{"text":"Measures"},{"text":"Calculated columns"},{"text":"Drill-through"},{"text":"Filters"},{"text":"Interactive dashboards"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Tableau"},{"type":"note","label":"Target","text":"Intermediate"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Dimensions"},{"text":"Measures"},{"text":"Calculated fields"},{"text":"Filters"},{"text":"Dashboards"},{"text":"Storytelling"},{"text":"The student does not need to master every BI platform. One platform at an advanced level is better than several at beginner level."}]}]},{"heading":"Data Cleaning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Data cleaning is one of the most important practical analyst skills."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to handle:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Missing values"},{"text":"Duplicate records"},{"text":"Invalid values"},{"text":"Outliers"},{"text":"Inconsistent categories"},{"text":"Date formatting"},{"text":"Data-type errors"},{"text":"Incorrect joins"},{"text":"Missing identifiers"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the difference between:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cleaning data and silently changing the meaning of the data."},{"text":"Every transformation should be reproducible and documented."}]}]},{"heading":"Business Analytics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Statistics alone is not enough."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Marketing Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Conversion rate"},{"text":"Customer acquisition cost"},{"text":"Customer lifetime value"},{"text":"Retention"},{"text":"Funnel analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Product Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"DAU/MAU"},{"text":"Retention"},{"text":"Churn"},{"text":"Activation"},{"text":"Feature adoption"},{"text":"Cohort analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Sales Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Pipeline"},{"text":"Conversion"},{"text":"Average order value"},{"text":"Sales forecasting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Operations Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Productivity"},{"text":"Capacity"},{"text":"Turnaround time"},{"text":"Inventory"},{"text":"Process efficiency"}]}]},{"heading":"Five Recommended UG Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — E-Commerce Sales Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyze:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Orders"},{"text":"Customers"},{"text":"Products"},{"text":"Regions"},{"text":"Profit margins"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Create:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SQL analysis"},{"text":"Python EDA"},{"text":"Power BI dashboard"},{"text":"Business recommendations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Customer Churn Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyze customer behaviour and identify factors associated with churn."},{"type":"p","text":"Use:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Statistical analysis"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Logistic regression"},{"text":"Power BI"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Output:"},{"type":"h","text":"Customer Churn Dashboard + Analytical Report"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Marketing Campaign Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyze:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Impressions"},{"text":"Clicks"},{"text":"Conversions"},{"text":"Campaign cost"},{"text":"ROI"},{"text":"Customer segments"},{"text":"Perform statistical comparison between campaigns."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Sales Forecasting"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a time-series analysis system."},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Trend"},{"text":"Seasonality"},{"text":"Moving averages"},{"text":"Forecast error"},{"text":"Regression/time-series models"},{"text":"Create a Power BI forecasting dashboard."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — A/B Testing Analytics Platform"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a